    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.diff\n\n### Description\n\nFor `mini.diff`, I'd like to use the `ignore_whitespace_change` parameter in `vim.diff()`. Using `set diffopt+=iwhite` didn't seem to change anything.\n\nI'm willing to create a PR if it's any trouble, but the contribution guide suggested getting feedback via an issue first.",
