    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nThis was already (somewhat) discussed in #1541 with resolution that I personally don't see a good reason for why using this kind of functionality is a good idea.\n\nClosing as not planned.\n\n---\n\n> I'm willing to create a PR if it's any trouble, but the contribution guide suggested getting feedback via an issue first.\n\nAnd thanks for reading contribution guides and creating an issue first. You saved both of use time in this case :)",
